 {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/stage_time\"},\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/attestation.schema.json:118:      \"required\": [\"attempts\", \"invocation_s\", \"partial\"],\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/attestation.schema.json:120:        \"attempts\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"minimum\": 0},\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/run:59:non-question retry below is a second invocation inside the same run).\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/run:130:# The counsel objective (issue #100): a stop is read inside the product\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/run:132:# the counsel structured answer is the shared adapter contract, not\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/run:336:def counsel_instruction() -> str:\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/run:339:    counsel_instruction -- the record, its log, the diff, the forge's\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/run:421:    # issue #175: attavo counsel N --ask hands the operator's own text as\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/run:433:        \"you are counseling a stop, read-only: make no edits, write no \"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/run:438:        \"class, or \\\"unclassed\\\"), one verdict -- \\\"answer\\\" (the stop is \"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/run:496:    # verify and counsel (issue #100) are mechanically read-only, not\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/run:617:    the non-question retry is a second invocation inside the same\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/run:703:# counsel run on a stop the definition of done never touches.\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/run:722:    split out from report_fields so a retry's first, discarded call\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/run:750:    counseling = stage == \"counsel\"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/run:753:    elif counseling:\n/Users/davidbean/Projec