ma.json:125:          \"description\": \"Populated for class \\\"unclassed\\\" (the log's last line, capped at 200 characters) and class \\\"question\\\" (the halt's own question, its first line only); null for every other class, whose evidence already lives in forge_checks or the log itself.\"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/verify.schema.json:129:    \"retry_of\": {\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/verify.schema.json:135:      \"description\": \"R3: the counsel or ruling record whose text this attempt was handed, or null\"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/build.schema.json:106:      \"description\": \"Issue #254: which guard refused this build -- the input derive_stop reads to class a refusal (environment: the [checks].command preflight, which builds its own stop). null unless status is \\\"refused\\\".\"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/build.schema.json:110:      \"description\": \"Issue #254: the class derive_stop was handed -- the adapter's report line's \\\"class\\\", or \\\"empty\\\" where the build itself found the executor committed nothing; null when neither. Stored as handed, so a later reader re-derives the stop from the record alone.\"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/build.schema.json:121:                   \"ceiling\", \"claims-boundary\", \"repeated-act\", \"unclassed\", \"question\",\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/build.schema.json:127:          \"description\": \"R3: the failure's signature, the detail or last event with every run of digits removed; equal between two attempts means the same failure\"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/build.schema.json:137:          \"description\": \"Populated for class \\\"unclassed\\\" (the log's last line, capped at 200 characters), class \\\"question\\\" (the halt's own question, its first line only), class \\\"environment\\\" ([checks].command's last output line, capped at 200 characters), and class \\\"gate\\\" (a refused spec-gate record's own refusal string, issue #137 -- never persisted on an actual build record; read here only because stop_class_enum sources the enum from this schema); null for every other class, whose evidence already lives in refusal, halted, or the log itself.\"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/build.schema.json:141:    \"retry_of\": {\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/build.schema.json:147:      \"description\": \"R3: the counsel or ruling record whose text this attempt was handed, or null\"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/counsel.schema.json:3:  \"$id\": \"https://attavo.dev/schema/records/counsel/3\",\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/counsel.schema.json:4:  \"title\": \"attavo counsel record (counsel-NN.json)\",\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/counsel.schema.json:20:      \"description\": \"Which stage's non-pass record this counsel invocation read -- \\\"spec\\\" is a refused spec-gate record, read only when no build or verify record exists yet.\"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/counsel.schema.json:25:      \"description\": \"The stem (e.g. \\\"build-01\\\" or \\\"spec-01\\\") of the non-pass record counsel read.\"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/counsel.schema.json:31:      \"description\": \"Copied verbatim from [executor.<adapter>] merged with [executor.<adapter>.counsel].\"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/counsel.schema.json:55:      \"description\": \"\\\"failed\\\" when the adapter exited non-zero or returned no usable structured answer; class, verdict, citations, and proposal are then null/empty.\"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/counsel.schema.json:60:               \"ceiling\", \"claims-boundary\", \"repeated-act\", \"unclassed\", null],\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/counsel.schema.json:61:      \"description\": \"The stop's class as counsel itself reads it -- independent of, and possibly disagreeing with, the stop.class the counseled record already carries.\"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/counsel.schema.json:116:      \"description\": \"counsel's own read of the forge on the counseled record's sha (issue #175) -- independent of, and read fresh from, whatever the counseled record's own forge_checks (verify only) already carries.\",\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/counsel.schema.json:122:          \"description\": \"false only for missing manifest configuration or a counseled record with no sha -- never silently treated as a green forge.\"\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/counsel.schema.json:130:          \"description\": \"One entry per check [forge].checks_command reported on the counseled sha -- [] both when read is false and when a real read found no checks at all.\",\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/schema/records/counsel.schema.json:145:      \"description\": \"The operator's own text from `attavo counsel N --ask \\\"<text>\\\"` -- null for the ordinary stop path.\"\n192:+{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_1\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\"sed -n '1,220p' attest/records/267/build-01.json && sed -n '1,120p' attest/records/267/build-01.log && sed -n '1,240p' attest/specs/267/spec.md 2>/dev/null || true && sed -n '1,120p' /var/folders/k6/kwlls81j5gvf1p1_hbh9mn8m0000gn/T/tmp7rot6rlz/checks.json && sed -n '1,160p' /var/folders/k6/kwlls81j5gvf1p1_hbh9mn8m0000gn/T/tmp7rot6rlz/graph.txt && sed -n '1,220p' attavo.toml\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"{\\n  \\\"sha\\\": \\\"22831ee93aa5d72a3a761ddea8cfb1895e24b8d7\\\",\\n  \\\"start_sha\\\": \\\"22831ee93aa5d72a3a761ddea8cfb1895e24b8d7\\\",\\n  \\\"spec_sha\\\": \\\"9f328be47311b149144abe7c4722ef5006130040\\\",\\n  \\\"approval_sha\\\": \\\"243a9c2190795c432fa08662722648349a71ebcf\\\",\\n  \\\"at\\\": \\\"2026-09-30T00:55:21Z\\\",\\n  \\\"adapter\\\": \\\"claude-code\\\",\\